Licence scope
=============

This repository contains data under two licences. Which one applies depends on the file.

  data/hsk-characters.json
  data/hsk-characters.csv
  data/summary.json
      -> CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)
         https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
         No rights reserved. No attribution required.

  data/hsk-words-by-level.json
      -> MIT Licence (text below), because the HSK 3.0 word lists are
         redistributed from TheOpenDictionary/complete-hsk-vocabulary (MIT).


