Upstream attribution
--------------------

HSK 3.0 word lists: TheOpenDictionary/complete-hsk-vocabulary (MIT Licence)

Deliberately NOT included:
  - CC-CEDICT definitions (CC BY-SA 4.0). Shipping them would place a share-alike
    obligation on this entire dataset, so the definition field is removed at
    generation time rather than merely "documented as third-party".
  - HanPath's own 13-language character glosses and error analyses, which are
    original expression and are not part of this dataset.
